@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title UC-Continuation — Continue Work and Record Custody
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

start
|Guest or Member|
:Request to continue a work-in-progress product\nin a later workshop session;
|Staff / Consultant|
:Locate current Booking and work item;
:Check a later session at the requested location for capacity;
if (Later session has capacity?) then (yes)
  :Create Staff-initiated linked continuation Booking;
  :Record custody intake:\nwork-item description, intake photo, location/time and Staff actor;
  |System|
  :Link continuation Booking and custody record\nto the work-in-progress item;
  :Do not automatically reserve any other session;
  |Guest or Member|
  :Receive continuation booking information;
else (no)
  :Explain no continuation slot can be created;
endif

|Staff / Consultant|
if (Customer returns for continuation or collection?) then (yes)
  :Verify booking code or QR;
  :Check the work item with customer;
  :Record auditable custody release / handover;
else (no)
endif

note right
Only Staff may create a continuation booking. The customer cannot self-create it and the system cannot auto-hold the next session.
end note
stop
@enduml
